OL,3,GNEWSASir Kevin Sinfield to lead new
OL,4,Acharity fun run
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer rugby league player Sir Kevin
OL,7,FSinfield has been announced as a host
OL,8,Ffor a town's first ever charity fun
OL,9,Frun.
OL,11,FHe will lead the new challenge, which
OL,12,Fcovers a distance of 7km (4.3 miles) in
OL,13,FCranbrook on Saturday, with all profits
OL,14,Fraised going to Sinfield's 7-in7
OL,15,FTogether charity, supporting his
OL,16,Fcontinued mission to champion those
OL,17,Fliving with motor neurone disease (MND)
OL,18,Fand the families affected by it.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
