OL,3,GNEWSASir Kevin Sinfield to lead new
OL,4,Acharity fun run
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe event is taking place at Cranbrook
OL,7,FRugby Club in a first for the town in
OL,8,FKent, which previously hosted a
OL,9,Ffundraising event for the him.
OL,11,FIt is open to people all of ages to
OL,12,Fparticipate, as well as community
OL,13,Fstalls based at the club for
OL,14,Fentertainment on the day.
